      what="Shook, who worked under Cho: “The words of Toyota Chairman Fujio Cho, ‘Go see, ask why, show respect,’ are now famous as basic lean principles. I first heard Mr. Cho speak those words when I was deputy general manager during the early 1990s start-up of the Toyota Supplier Support Center in the U.S.”",
